ion & Learning"],"schemeName":"Nagaland State Merit Scholarship","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"nsms","briefDescription":"The Directorate of Higher Education has launched the Nagaland State Merit Scholarship for the students of classes from 11th to 12th and UG Degree to PG degree so that they will be able to secure their scholarship rights or seats after getting online registration under this scholarship. ","tags":["Nagaland State","Merit Scholarship","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"iAyOyokBvvukECfi2-j-","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"CEAF","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Children Education Assistance Fund","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"ceaf","briefDescription":"Children Education Assistance Fund (CEAF) is a scheme launched by the Nagaland state government to provide financial assistance to children who are studying in classes 1 to 10 in government schools. The scheme aims to ensure that no child is deprived of education due to financial constraints.","tags":["Children Education","Assistance Fund","Scholarship","Student Finance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"PQyOyokB1csUTixB2t_9","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"CMMFI","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance"],"schemeName":"Chief Minister's Micro Finance Initiative","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"cmmfi","briefDescription":"The Union Minister, Finance and Corporate Affairs, Nirmala Sitharaman and Chief Minister of Nagaland Neiphiu Rio jointly launched the Chief Minister’s Micro Finance Initiative at Capital Cultural Hall, Kohima on 23rd August 2022.","tags":["Micro Finance","Banking And Money","Financial Assistance","Business"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"RwyOyokBvvukECfi2Ohk","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"SRSN","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"State Research Scholarship","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"srsn","briefDescription":"This scholarship is specially designed for students who are pursuing research work. Under the scheme, beneficiaries will get cash awards to conduct their research work. ","tags":["State Research Scholarship","Nagaland","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"hwyOyokBvvukECfi2-j4","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"SSSGHID","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Stipend To Students Studying At Govt. Hindi Institute Dimapur","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"sssghid","briefDescription":"The Department has given Stipend to the students studying at Govt. Hindi Institute Dimapur every year from the allocated fund under Scholarship by the State Govt. This scholarship is availed by the students studying in this institute, from the year 2015-16.","tags":[]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"AwyOyokBvvukECfi4emt","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"ICDSS","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment","Health & Wellness"],"schemeName":"Integrated Child Development Services Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"icdss","briefDescription":"In Nagaland, the ICDS programme was launched in the year 1975 in the Jalukie block of Peren district with 50 Anganwadi centres. The programme has since grown and at present, there are 60 (sixty) ICDS projects in 11 (Eleven) districts of the State. ","tags":["Integrated Child Development Services","Nagaland"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"GwyOyokBvvukECfi4ulu","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"PMSSCSN","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Post Matric Scholarship To Scheduled Caste Students Of Nagaland","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"pmsscsn","briefDescription":"The Directorate of Higher Education (DHE) has launched the Post Matric Scholarship to ST students of the Nagaland scheme for providing socio-economic welfare to the students belonging to the residentship of Nagaland state. The student must be studying or getting admission to the post-matric class.","tags":["Post Matric Scholarship","Student","Scheduled Caste","Nagaland","Higher Education"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"5gKOyokBsSMYTfzi5N6j","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"SFGSSS","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning","Women and Child"],"schemeName":"Stipend For Girls Of Secondary Students Schemes","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"sfgsss","briefDescription":"The Nagaland Stipend for Girls of Secondary Students scheme is a scholarship program launched by the Government of Nagaland with the aim of promoting and encouraging girl students to continue their education beyond the secondary level. ","tags":["Stipend For Girls","Students","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"MAKOyokBsSMYTfzi294D","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"CMHISN","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Health & Wellness"],"schemeName":"Chief Minister’s Health Insurance Scheme - Nagaland","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"cmhisn","briefDescription":"The Chief Minister Health Insurance Scheme (CMHIS) is a health insurance scheme that provides financial protection to the citizens of the state against the cost of hospitalization and medical treatment. The scheme is aimed at providing health insurance coverage to the citizens of Nagaland.","tags":["Health Coverage","Health Insurance","Nagaland Government Health Insurance","Affordable Health Insurance","Cashless Health Insurance","Nagaland"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"_wKOyokBsSMYTfzi2d0V","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"NSBGS","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"NEC Stipend And Book Grant Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"nsbgs","briefDescription":"This scholarship scheme is offered to the students pursuing higher professional courses and belongs to ST and general category. Only Nagaland domiciled candidates will be eligible to apply for this scheme.","tags":["NEC Stipend","Book Grant","Nagaland","Fellowship"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"LQyOyokBvvukECfi4-lb","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Nagaland"],"schemeShortTitle":"SUH","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Agriculture,Rural & Environment","Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Scholarship Under Horticulture","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"suh","briefDescription":"The Department of Horticulture, Government of Nagaland provides various scholarships and financial assistance schemes to encourage and support students pursuing horticulture studies in the state.","tags":["Scholarship","Horticulture","Scholarship"]},"highlight":{}}],"page":{"total":11,"totalPages":1,"pageNumber":0,"from":0,"size":100}},"sortedBy":"multiple_sort"}}